{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The harness now has five voters produce replies for one read context, holds those replies, and applies an explicit joint change to incoming voters `{1,4,5}`. It then releases replies from 2, 3, and 4 in order. The oracle counts delivered sender IDs independently of the implementation’s acknowledgment map and observes `Ready.ReadStates`.\n"}}
